+A smart, AI-powered personal finance management application that helps you track expenses, analyze spending patterns, and make informed financial decisions.
 
 ---
 
-## ✨ Highlights  
+## ✨ Highlights
 
-- 🚀 Developed a **smart, AI-powered personal finance application** with seamless UX.  
-- 🎨 Built the **frontend** using **HTML, Tailwind CSS, and Vanilla JavaScript**, featuring a responsive UI and interactive **Chart.js** dashboards.  
-- 🧠 Engineered an **AI backend** with **FastAPI + PyTorch/Transformers**, integrating multiple intelligent models:  
-  - **NLP models** for expense categorization & adaptive pattern learning.  
-  - **OCR pipeline** using **Tesseract + OpenCV** for automated receipt scanning & text extraction.  
-  - **Time-series forecasting** with **Prophet** and **Statsmodels** to predict monthly spending trends.  
-  - **Anomaly detection** via **PyOD** and statistical methods to flag unusual expenses.  
-- 🔄 Designed **adaptive learning pipelines** to improve categorization suggestions continuously.  
-- 📊 Delivered **AI-driven dashboards** showing savings rates, category breakdowns, predictive alerts, and budget utilization.  
-- ☁️ **Deployed on Vercel**, enabling scalability, cross-device accessibility, and smooth **CI/CD workflow**.  
+- **AI-powered auto-categorization** — instantly suggests expense categories as you type using local keyword matching, with an async backend call for higher confidence when the server is running
+- **Groq AI chat assistant** — conversational finance advisor powered by Llama 3.1 (free tier), with full awareness of your current month's income, spending, savings rate, and budget alerts
+- **Interactive analytics dashboards** — expense pie/donut chart, 6-month income vs expense trend line, and budget vs actual bar chart — all rendered on native canvas (no Chart.js dependency)
+- **Receipt scanning** — upload or photograph a receipt for automatic OCR extraction of vendor, amount, and date using OpenCV + Tesseract (optional backend feature)
+- **Spending forecasting** — Prophet-based 30-day predictions with confidence intervals (optional backend feature)
+- **Anomaly detection** — Isolation Forest flags unusual expenses compared to your historical patterns (optional backend feature)
+- **Adaptive learning** — the backend learns from every transaction you add, improving category suggestions over time
+- **Secure authentication** — passwords hashed with SHA-256 (browser-native `crypto.subtle`) with automatic migration from any plaintext legacy passwords
+- **Works offline** — the full app runs without the backend; AI categorization falls back to local keyword matching, and the Groq chat goes directly to the API
 
