+
+### Core
+| Feature | Description |
+|---|---|
+| Transaction Management | Add, edit, delete income and expenses with date, amount, and category |
+| Budget Tracking | Set per-category budget limits and track utilization with progress bars |
+| Monthly Overview | Filter all views by month; dashboard cards show income, expenses, and net balance |
+| Export / Import | Download your data as JSON or restore from a previous export |
+| Custom Categories | Add your own income or expense categories beyond the defaults |
+| Financial Goals | Set annual savings goal, monthly income target, and emergency fund target |
+
+### AI Features
+| Feature | Backend Required | Description |
+|---|---|---|
+| Smart Categorization (local) | No | Instant keyword matching across 10 categories as you type |
+| Smart Categorization (AI) | Yes | Backend keyword + optional BERT semantic matching |
+| Groq AI Chat | No (API key only) | Conversational assistant with live financial context |
+| Receipt OCR | Yes (OpenCV) | Auto-fills form from uploaded receipt image |
+| Spending Forecast | Yes (Prophet) | Predicts next 30-day spending with trend direction |
+| Anomaly Detection | Yes (sklearn) | Flags expenses that deviate from your norms |
+| Advanced Insights | Yes (pandas) | Day-of-week patterns, seasonality, budget optimisation suggestions |
 
