+## 📖 Usage Guide
+
+### Adding a Transaction
+1. Select the month at the top of the Dashboard
+2. Type what you bought in the description field — AI will instantly suggest a category
+3. Click the suggestion to auto-fill Type and Category, or select manually
+4. Enter the amount and date
+5. Optionally upload a receipt image for automatic data extraction
+6. Click **Add Transaction**
+
+### AI Chat Assistant
+1. Go to **Settings → AI Features** and paste your free [Groq API key](https://console.groq.com)
+2. Click **Save**
+3. Click the **🤖** button (bottom-right corner) to open the chat
+4. Ask anything — the assistant sees your current month's income, spending, savings rate, and budget alerts
+
+### Analytics
+- Navigate to **Analytics** to see:
+  - Expense breakdown donut chart with legend
+  - 6-month income vs expense trend
+  - Budget vs actual per category
+  - AI-generated insights (savings rate, top category, budget alerts, spending patterns)
+
+### Export & Import
+- **Settings → Data Management → Export Data** downloads a `.json` file with all transactions, budgets, and goals
+- **Import Data** lets you restore or merge a previous export
 
