-📞 Support & Contact
+- Passwords are hashed with **SHA-256** using `crypto.subtle` in the browser before being stored in localStorage — plaintext passwords are never written
+- Existing accounts with plaintext passwords are **automatically migrated** to hashed on next login
+- The Groq API key is stored only in your browser's localStorage and is never sent anywhere except directly to the Groq API (via your own backend)
 
